## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to reason about amortized cost with periodic rebuilds in streaming/indexing.

## Key Concepts

- amortized analysis
- batch processing
- cache locality

## Code Example

```javascript
// Implementation sketch
function rebuildIndex(blocks) {
  const map = new Map();
  let offset = 0;
  for (const b of blocks) {
    map.set(b.id, offset);
    offset += b.length;
  }
  return map;
}
```

